  "content_description": "",
  "content_text_body": "When you spend time supporting and communicating with your team, they feel a greater sense of belonging. \n\n### Spend quality time coaching\nBe sure that each team member gets some coaching to help them build and develop their skills. This regular support will also enhance their sense of belonging.\n\n### Regularly focus on individual team members\nSpend one meeting per month focusing on each team member. Encourage them to share their ideas, tell stories, and discuss projects.\n\n### Over communicate with remote workers and contractors\nRemote employees and contractors especially, need to be attended to as they don't have the same level of involvement as other employees.",
